# Local secrets (DO NOT COMMIT)

Copy becomes `me/.private/secrets.local.md` on first vault init.

Values are stored in **plaintext on disk** under a hidden `.private/` folder.
Prefer full-disk encryption (BitLocker / FileVault / LUKS). This is convenience
capture, not a password manager.

